      "before_sha256": "8f8de53a8c3873d44d6c4315d282a32e8605040eb34af2e82a3663b3b7f6cc97",
      "reason": "C实际为PAgP；passive会响应LACP。",
      "updates": {
        "prompt": "Refer to the exhibit. Both switches use compatible Layer 2 settings and their member interfaces are up. An engineer configures LACP EtherChannel between Switch 1 and Switch 2. Which mode pairing makes only Switch 1 initiate LACP negotiation?",
        "explanation": "A。Switch 1 的 active 模式主动发起 LACP 协商，Switch 2 的 passive 模式不主动发起，但会回应收到的 LACP PDU，协商后仍可发送协议报文。成员接口及聚合口的速率、双工和交换模式等必须兼容。B 两端 passive 不会自行发起；C 的 auto/desirable 是 PAgP 而非 LACP；D 的 on 为静态聚合，不发起 LACP，不能与 passive 构成题设协商。"
      },
