      "original_qid": "Q1060",
      "before_sha256": "01df01a0c26e4f03b16ec14d326762b6e2aeb3211b4acc10fc9c497fd6c2a46e",
      "reason": "明确题设包含PAT，修复题干拼写，保留NAT命令。",
      "updates": {
        "prompt": "Refer to the exhibit. Configure Ethernet0 as the inside interface and Serial0 as the outside interface, publish the web server at TCP port 80, and enable PAT for the inside subnet using the existing ACL. Place each command in its configuration position. Assume reachability, addressing and the gateway are correctly configured.",
        "explanation": "A：`ip address 172.16.1.1 255.255.255.0`；B：`ip nat inside`；C：`ip address 45.83.2.214 255.255.255.240`；D：`ip nat outside`；E：`ip nat inside source static tcp 172.16.1.2 80 45.83.2.214 80 extendable`；F：`ip nat inside source list 1 interface s0 overload`。E 是 Web 服务的静态 TCP 端口映射；F 将 ACL 1 选中的内部源地址做接口地址复用。仅发布 Web 服务不必然需要 PAT；题设额外要求它。仍需路由、服务器默认网关及安全策略允许对应流量。"
      },
